#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Fail-open lifecycle client for explicitly configured BORG peers.

The client has no local vector store. It performs bounded recall and sends only
redacted user/tool evidence to the configured scoped Mem0 service.

Modes:
  prime   SessionStart generation marker
  start   UserPromptSubmit recall injection
  post_tool  Grok PostToolUse recall from a validated session tail
  prepare   Grok client-boundary plain context preparation
  commit    Grok client-boundary delivery acknowledgement
  pre_tool  Grok direct PreToolUse context preparation
  end     Stop/SessionEnd evidence queue
  enqueue  Persist one already-validated Hermes lifecycle envelope
  replay  bounded retry of retained capture requests
  worker  Internal detached capture worker

Grok's client-boundary path supplies context before a turn and its direct
PreToolUse path supplies context for a tool turn; PostToolUse only commits a
successful pending delivery.

Kill switch: touch ``BORG_HOME/mem0/HOOK_OFF``
"""

